        "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
        "text": "Um so I didn't really know what kind of functions we had to put into it yet .",
        "participant": "MTD022ID",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.119",
        "participant": "MTD021PM",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Mm-hmm ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.84",
        "participant": "MTD022ID",
        "role": "ID",
        "text": "So uh uh this is basically an overview of what we discussed in our last uh meeting ."
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The User Interface Designer will design the LCD screen function menu."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#1",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The User Interface Designer will prepare a list of the functions to be shown on the screen/menu."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#2",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The UI Designer will group the menu into a display group and a basic functions group."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#3",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "ID will design the layout of the LCD screen."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#4",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Elderly users may not understand the remote well; a simpler remote is needed."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#5",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Teletext functionality will be skipped and not used in the project."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#6",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The target age range is sixteen to forty."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#7",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We should have two different groups of functions: simple for the general public and advanced for younger users."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#8",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The LCD/TV options menu should be activated by software options."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#9",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The extra advanced options should be on the onscreen display."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#10",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The screen should be placed on the top."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006b#11",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The Project Manager will reorganize the project materials after this meeting."
      }
    ],
